### Receipts API Tests
@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/health

### Create a new receipt
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "store_name": "Sephora",
  "store_category": "Beauty & Cosmetics",
  "store_address": "26736 Portola Parkway Suite 6-C, Foothill Ranch, CA 92610",
  "store_phone": "(949) 382-1982",
  "date": "2024-08-25",
  "subtotal": 19.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "2380749",
      "name": "OS EYE PENCIL BOHIAS BLK",
      "description": "12HR Contour Eye Pencil Eyeliner in Bodacious Black - waterproof gel eyeliner pencil",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_price": 19.00
    }
  ]
}

### Create another receipt for testing
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "store_name": "Target",
  "store_category": "Retail",
  "store_address": "123 Main St, Anytown, CA 90210",
  "store_phone": "(555) 123-4567",
  "date": "2024-08-26",
  "subtotal": 45.99,
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "TARGET001",
      "name": "Household Cleaner",
      "description": "Multi-purpose household cleaning spray",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit_price": 12.99
    },
    {
      "sku": "TARGET002", 
      "name": "Paper Towels",
      "description": "6-pack premium paper towels",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_price": 19.99
    }
  ]
}

### Get all receipts
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/receipts

### Get a specific receipt by ID (replace {id} with actual ID from creation)
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/receipts/1

### Get another receipt by ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/receipts/2

### Delete a receipt (replace {id} with actual ID)
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/v1/receipts/1

### Verify deletion - should return 404
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/receipts/1